<p>AdsRanger ("AdsRanger", "we", "us") is a platform that helps marketing agencies and businesses create, manage and report on advertising across ad networks such as Meta, Google, TikTok, Snapchat, Microsoft, LinkedIn and X, and manage organic social content. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it and the choices you have.</p>
<div class="note">AdsRanger is operated from Amman, Jordan. The name of the operating company will be shown here once its registration is complete. Contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@adsranger.com">privacy@adsranger.com</a></div>

<h2>1. Data we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Account data:</strong> your name, email address, password (stored only as a secure hash), role and the agency workspace you belong to.</li>
<li><strong>Data you add:</strong> clients, goals, notes, tasks, reports, creatives and other content you enter or upload.</li>
<li><strong>Data from connected ad platforms:</strong> when you connect an account through the platform's own sign-in (OAuth), we receive an access token and, within the permissions you approve: ad account and business IDs and names, campaigns, ad sets, ads, creatives, budgets, audiences metadata, performance metrics, conversions and, if you turn on the leads features, lead form submissions.</li>
<li><strong>Data from connected organic accounts:</strong> pages and profiles you connect, their posts, comments, messages and insights, and the content you schedule through AdsRanger.</li>
<li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages used and error logs, kept for security and to keep the service running.</li>
<li><strong>Cookies:</strong> we use the cookies needed to keep you signed in, remember your language and protect forms. On the public website, and only if you click "Accept analytics", we also use Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages are used; it runs with Google's advertising features off. If you choose "Essential only", Google Analytics is not loaded. You can change your choice any time in <a href="#" data-cookie-settings>cookie settings</a>. We do not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. We keep Google Analytics data for 14 months; then it is deleted automatically.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How we use data</h2>
<ul>
<li>To provide the features you use: dashboards, reports, alerts, budget tools, ad creation and publishing, post scheduling and the inbox.</li>
<li>To make changes in your ad accounts only when you or a teammate tells AdsRanger to (for example publishing an ad or changing a budget).</li>
<li>To create AI summaries, drafts and suggestions for you. Our AI providers process this data only to return results to you and do not use it to train their models.</li>
<li>To secure the service, prevent abuse, fix problems and meet legal obligations.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell personal data. We do not use data from connected platforms to build advertising profiles, to target ads, or for any purpose other than providing AdsRanger to the user who connected it.</p>

<h2>3. Google user data</h2>
<p>AdsRanger's use and transfer of information received from Google APIs to any other app will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements. We use Google Ads, Google Analytics and Google Merchant Center data only to show, report on and manage the accounts you connect, and we do not let humans read this data unless you ask us to for support, it is needed for security or law, or it has been aggregated and anonymised.</p>

<h2>4. Meta, TikTok, Snapchat and other platforms</h2>
<p>Data received from Meta (Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp), TikTok, Snapchat, Microsoft, LinkedIn, X and other networks is used only to provide AdsRanger features to the agency that connected the account, in line with each platform's developer terms and policies. You can revoke access at any time in AdsRanger or in the platform's own settings.</p>

<h2>5. Who we share data with</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Your team and your clients:</strong> members of your agency workspace, and the clients you choose to share reports or links with.</li>
<li><strong>Service providers:</strong> hosting, email delivery, payments and AI processing, under contracts that limit their use of the data to serving us.</li>
<li><strong>The ad platforms themselves:</strong> when you publish or change something, the needed data is sent to that platform.</li>
<li><strong>Legal reasons:</strong> when required by law, or to protect users and the service.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Security</h2>
<p>Connections use HTTPS. Platform access tokens and API keys are encrypted in our database. Access inside AdsRanger is limited by roles, and administrative changes are recorded in an audit log.</p>

<h2>7. How long we keep data</h2>
<p>We keep data while your account is active. If you disconnect a platform, we stop collecting from it and delete its tokens straight away; the data already collected from it is deleted within 30 days unless you ask to keep it for reporting. When an account is closed, its data is deleted within 30 days, and removed from backups within a further 30 days.</p>

<h2>8. Your rights and choices</h2>
<ul>
<li>See, export or correct your data from inside AdsRanger, or ask us by email.</li>
<li>Disconnect any platform at any time, and revoke AdsRanger in that platform's settings.</li>
<li>Ask us to delete your data. See <a href="/en/data-deletion">Data Deletion</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>9. Children</h2>
<p>AdsRanger is a business service and is not meant for anyone under 18.</p>

<h2>10. Changes</h2>
<p>We will post any changes on this page and update the date above. For important changes we will also notify account owners by email.</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>
<p>Questions or requests: <a href="mailto:privacy@adsranger.com">privacy@adsranger.com</a></p>
